{"words": [{"text": "فَإِن", "translation": "But if"}, {"text": "لَّمْ", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "تَفْعَلُوا۟", "translation": "you do"}, {"text": "وَلَن", "translation": "and never"}, {"text": "تَفْعَلُوا۟", "translation": "will you do"}, {"text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translation": "then fear"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارَ", "translation": "the Fire"}, {"text": "ٱلَّتِى", "translation": "whose"}, {"text": "وَقُودُهَا", "translation": "[its] fuel"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسُ", "translation": "(is) [the] men"}, {"text": "وَٱلْحِجَارَةُ ۖ", "translation": "and [the] stones"}, {"text": "أُعِدَّتْ", "translation": "prepared"}, {"text": "لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ", "translation": "for the disbelievers"}], "sahih": "But if you do not - and you will never be able to - then fear the Fire, whose fuel is people and stones, prepared for the disbelievers."}